      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $G,$ given by\n\n$$\nG=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation ${R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-5{R}_{2}$ on $G?$",
